config XIAO_RP2350_BARGRAPH_BOARD
	bool "Seeed Studio XIAO RP2350 Breadboard Bar-Graph Board"
	default y
	---help---
		Out-of-tree custom board configuration for a Seeed Studio
		XIAO RP2350 with 1 potentiometer on A0/D0 (GPIO26) and
		6 discrete bar-graph LEDs on D3..D8 (GPIO5, GPIO6, GPIO7,
		GPIO0, GPIO1, GPIO2).
